---
---
<section class="section-shell about-section" id="about">
    <div class="section-heading">
        <span class="eyebrow">About this space</span>
        <h2>A small space for<br /><em>work in progress.</em></h2>
        <p>A home for Sora Astral projects, experiments, and the places where new ideas begin.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="about-layout">
        <article class="material-card about-intro">
            <div class="about-intro__image"><img src="/sora-profile.jpg" alt="Sora" loading="eager" decoding="async" /></div>
            <div class="about-intro__content">
                <div class="card-kicker">01 / PURPOSE</div>
                <h3>Built for curious people.</h3>
                <p>A personal web portal for AI companions, interactive stories, and experiments that are still finding their shape.</p>
                <div class="about-intro__actions"><button class="text-button" id="easterEggTitle" type="button">A note from the maker <svg class="icon-inline" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 13 13 3M5 3h8v8" /></svg></button><a class="button button--quiet" href="https://github.com/celestial-sora" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub <svg class="icon-inline" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 13 13 3M5 3h8v8" /></svg></a></div>
                <p class="about-secret" id="aboutSecret" hidden>I like building strange things until they work.</p>
            </div>
        </article>

        <div class="about-stats">
            <article class="stat-card"><span class="stat-index">A</span><strong>Web &amp; Apps</strong><small>Central hub</small></article>
            <article class="stat-card"><span class="stat-index">B</span><strong>AI Systems</strong><small>Memory · Roleplay · Vision</small></article>
            <article class="stat-card"><span class="stat-index">C</span><strong>Open Source</strong><small>Code that stays curious</small></article>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<script>
    const easterEgg = document.getElementById('easterEggTitle');
    const secret = document.getElementById('aboutSecret');
    easterEgg?.addEventListener('click', () => {
        if (secret) secret.hidden = !secret.hidden;
    });
</script>
